g</a>                                          </td>\n<td>26</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>27</td>\n<td>29</td>\n<td>−2</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">35</td>\n</tr><tr style=\"background:white;\"> <td>9</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Malm%C3%B6_FF\" title=\"Malmö FF\">Malmö FF</a>                                              </td>\n<td>26</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>11</td>\n<td>35</td>\n<td>30</td>\n<td>+5</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">33</td>\n</tr><tr style=\"background:white; border-bottom:2px solid red;\"> <td>10</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/IF_Elfsborg\" title=\"IF Elfsborg\">IF Elfsborg</a>                                           </td>\n<td>26</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>36</td>\n<td>33</td>\n<td>+3</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">33</td>\n</tr><tr style=\"background:#f4dcdc;\"> <td>11</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Trelleborgs_FF\" title=\"Trelleborgs FF\">Trelleborgs FF</a> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Kvar i ligan efter kvalspel\"><img alt=\"Kvar i ligan efter kvalspel\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fe/Dark_Green_Arrow_Down.svg/20px-Dark_Green_Arrow_Down.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"700\" data-file-height=\"700\" /></span></span>                              </td>\n<td>26</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>31</td>\n<td>35</td>\n<td>−4</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">32</td>\n</tr><tr style=\"background:#f4dcdc; border-bottom:2px solid red;\"> <td>12</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96rgryte_IS\" title=\"Örgryte IS\">Örgryte IS</a> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Kvar i ligan efter kvalspel\"><img alt=\"Kvar i ligan efter kvalspel\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fe/Dark_Green_Arrow_Down.svg/20px-Dark_Green_Arrow_Down.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"700\" data-file-height=\"700\" /></span></span>                                  </td>\n<td>26</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>35</td>\n<td>36</td>\n<td>−1</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">28</td>\n</tr><tr style=\"background:#f0c4c4;\"> <td>13</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/BK_H%C3%A4cken\" title=\"BK Häcken\">BK Häcken</a> <span style=\"cursor:help;color:dimgrey;font-size:0.8em;font-weight:bold;\" title=\"Uppflyttad från föregående säsong\">(U)</span>                                     </td>\n<td>26</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>13</td>\n<td>27</td>\n<td>46</td>\n<td>−19</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">27</td>\n</tr><tr style=\"background:#f0c4c4;\"> <td>14</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96sters_IF\" title=\"Östers IF\">Östers IF</a>                                             </td>\n<td>26</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>14</td>\n<td>26</td>\n<td>43</td>\n<td>−17</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">22</td>\n</tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Resultattabell\">Resultattabell</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_1998&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Resultattabell\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_1998&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Resultattabell\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>&#160;<span class=\"noprint plainlinks\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:normal; font-size:80%; ;\">Denna tabell:&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Mall:Resultattabell_f%C3%B6r_Fotbollsallsvenskan_1998\" title=\"Mall:Resultattabell för Fotbollsallsvenskan 1998\"><spa